OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest after police called
OL,4,Ato street disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurder over the death of another man in
OL,8,Fthe West Midlands.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to disorder in
OL,11,FShustoke Road, Solihull, just before
OL,12,F21:25 BST on Saturday, West Midlands
OL,13,FPolice said.
OL,15,F"A man in his 40s was found in the
OL,16,Fstreet with serious injuries and was
OL,17,Fconfirmed dead at the scene," said a
OL,18,Fpolice spokesperson.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
